e great sages have no information that\nBeyond this physical sky, there is a spiritual sky where Shri Krishna, along with his companions, eternally resides.\nAlthough, along with that, they repeatedly display their mortal world's pastimes in all the universes. This is confirmed in the Brahmasamhita (5.37)-- Goloka eva nivas-\ntyakhalatmabhutah-- God, with his inconceivable power, lives in his eternal abode, Goloka, yet"
