ervice to God.\nThe definition of the devotion-method accomplished under the rules of valid power is given by the scriptures\nand has been completed by great teachers. Such practice can be helpful for a newly initiated devotee in reaching the state of devotion, in which God, the Chaityaguru, that is, the form of superconsciousness,\nanswers from within as a guru. In addition to devotees, all spiritualists do not differentiate between the individual soul and the Supreme Soul,\nbecause they make the mistake of considering the superconscious and the individual consciousness as one.\nHmm. Such a mistake made by the devotees makes them ineligible to receive any guidance from within, therefore they"
